### Health Check
GET https://plantshop-ecommerce-production.up.railway.app/api/health

### Obtener todas las guías
GET https://plantshop-ecommerce-production.up.railway.app/api/dendrosfera/guides

### Obtener recomendación por tipo (Monstera)
GET https://plantshop-ecommerce-production.up.railway.app/api/dendrosfera/recommendation?plantType=Monstera

### Obtener recomendación por tipo (Potus)
GET https://plantshop-ecommerce-production.up.railway.app/api/dendrosfera/recommendation?plantType=Potus

### Obtener recomendación desde especie científica
POST https://plantshop-ecommerce-production.up.railway.app/api/dendrosfera/recommendation/from-species
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scientificName": "Monstera deliciosa"
}

### Probar con especie no mapeada
POST https://plantshop-ecommerce-production.up.railway.app/api/dendrosfera/recommendation/from-species
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scientificName": "Rosa gallica"
}
